### 0. Login as ADMIN -> saves {{adminToken}}
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/authenticate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "admin" }

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.token); %}

### 0b. Login as USER -> saves {{userToken}}
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/authenticate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "user", "password": "user" }

> {% client.global.set("userToken", response.body.token); %}

### 1. CREATE with JWT (admin) -> 200, createdBy = "admin"
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "100", "name": "QQQ", "description": "audit demo" }

### 2. UPDATE with JWT (user) -> 200, createdBy = "admin", lastModifiedBy = "user"
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/100
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "QQQ-updated", "description": "changed by user" }

### 3. DELETE as USER -> 403 Forbidden (only ADMIN may delete)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/100
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 4. DELETE as ADMIN -> 204, console prints "AUDIT: item 100 deleted by admin at ..."
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/100
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

